+config LEDS_QCOM_PMI8950_TORCH
+	tristate "Qualcomm PMI8950 diagnostic torch support"
+	depends on LEDS_CLASS
+	depends on OF
+	depends on SPMI
+	help
+	  This driver provides bounded, low-current diagnostic control of the
+	  two torch channels in the legacy Qualcomm PMI8950 flash block. Each
+	  channel is exposed independently at the minimum current code and is
+	  forced off after 500 ms.
+
+	  This initial driver intentionally provides neither photo-flash nor
+	  camera/V4L2 integration.
+
